                        "sense_id": "cff3aade-c249-346f-b419-ee80185193e5",
                        "entry_id": "bb8dc2f9-0adb-3fe0-8366-5020df4d3f90",
                        "glosses": [
                            "quadrangular"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b5d1db27-6a78-4de1-9ade-ed36f31d3818",
                                "sense_id": "cff3aade-c249-346f-b419-ee80185193e5",
                                "text": "До сих по́р Гри́ша знал оди́н то́лько четырёхуго́льный мир, где в одно́м углу́ стои́т его́ крова́ть, в друго́м — ня́нькин сунду́к, в тре́тьем — стул, а в четвёртом — гори́т лампа́дка.",
                                "translation": "Hitherto Grisha has known only a rectangular world, where in one corner stands his bed, in the other nurse's trunk, in the third a chair, while in the fourth there is a little lamp burning.",
                                "english": "Hitherto Grisha has known only a rectangular world, where in one corner stands his bed, in the other nurse's trunk, in the third a chair, while in the fourth there is a little lamp burning."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
